  {t="Divine Grace: High Priestess Laurena", lv=10, n="At 10, go to High Priestess Laurena at the altar of the Cathedral of Light, in Stormwind's Cathedral Square, and take her quest: she teaches Divine Grace on the spot. No letter needed; one from another trainer works too (next steps). Divine Grace instantly heals a friend below half health and clears Weakened Soul, so you can shield them again (5-minute cooldown); it does not work on yourself. Human priests do not get Desperate Prayer in Forever: this is their spell instead.", w={{k="onquest",neg=true,q={94773,94774,94775,94776,94777,94778,94779}}}, g={{"l",10,txt="Reach level 10"},{"a",94773,m=1453,x=49.5,y=44.6,ml=10},{"t",94773,n2="High Priestess Laurena: Divine Grace",m=1453,x=49.5,y=44.6}}},
